## Resolution rules
- **Autoscan**: If no `font_dirs` in rheo.toml, auto-include `fonts/` dir at project root if it exists
- **Config replaces autoscan**: If `font_dirs` is set in rheo.toml, autoscan is skipped (user must include "fonts" explicitly)
- **CLI appends**: `--font-dir` flags always append on top of whatever config/autoscan resolved

