    .plugin_sections
    .get(plugin.name())
    .unwrap_or(&default_section);
```

Use this single reference for both `resolve_assets()` and the copy-patterns loop. Remove both calls to `project.config.plugin_section()`.

### Step 4 — Wire up in `perform_compilation()`

Replace the existing asset resolution block (lines 352-379) with:
```rust
