```

Update the copy-patterns loop to use `plugin_section` (the borrowed reference) instead of `plugin_section_for_copy`.

Update the spine resolution to use `plugin_section.spine.as_ref()` instead of `project.config.spine_for_plugin(plugin.name())`, since we already have the section.

Pass `plugin_section` to `PluginContext` and `PerFileCtx` as the existing `&PluginSection` reference.

